		(at 156.7275 132.9 180)
		(descr "KANGNEX WJ500V-5.08-2P, 2-position Eurostyle PCB screw terminal block, 5.08mm pitch (LCSC C8465). Land pattern and 3D model are the VENDOR's own, pulled via easyeda2kicad 2026-07-26 -- this replaces the hand-built TerminalBlock_MRR52-5.08-2P (Adam Tech drawing, 1.5mm holes) now that the part is sourced from LCSC. Recommended hole 1.30mm, pad 2.00mm (annular ring 0.35mm, vs the 0.15mm .dru minimum). Body 10.16 x 10.16mm; the pin row is NOT centred -- 5.64mm to the wire-entry face (-Y, marked by the silk arrows) and 4.52mm to the back. Origin is centred between the two pins.")
